  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong> <a style=\"color: #ff0000;\" href=\"https://upsssc.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Uttar Pradesh Subordinate Service Selection Board (UPSSSC)</a></span> has released the Medical Admit Card on its official website for the Recruitment of Forest Guard Examination 2025. Applications for the UPSSSC Forest Guard, Wild Life Guard Recruitment 2023 were accepted from September 20, 2023, to October 10, 2023. <span style=\"font-size: inherit;\">The vacancy came in the year 2023 and it took almost three year one month to conduct the Medical examination for the prescribed posts. The Medical examination is going to be conducted on 15 June 2026. Candidates who qualified PET/PMT examination</span> can check their UPSSSC Forest/ Wild Life Guard 2023 Medical Admit Card 2026 from the direct link provided below.</span></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-2\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Uttar Pradesh Subordinate Service Selection Board (UPSSSC)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">UPSSSC Forest/ Wild Life Guard 2023 Admit Card 2026</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">UPSSSC Advt No. : 10-Exam/2023</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>20 September 2023</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date : <strong>10 October 2023</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Fee Payment Last Date : <strong>10 October 2023</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Correction Last Date :&nbsp;<b>17 October 2023</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Eligibility Result Available :&nbsp;<b>07October 2024</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Exam Date :&nbsp;<b>09 November 2025</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Exam City Available :<b> 30 October 2025</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Admit Card Available :<b> 06 November 2025</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Answer Key :&nbsp;<strong>10 November 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Result : <strong>08 January 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">PET &amp; PMT Date&nbsp;<strong>: From 10 February 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">PET &amp; PMT Admit Card : <strong>04 February 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">PET &amp; PMT Result : <strong>30 April 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Medical Exam Date : <b>15 June 2026</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Medical Admit Card : <b>09 June 2026</b></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">General, OBC, EWS : <strong>Rs.</strong> <b>25/-</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">SC, ST : <strong>Rs.</strong> <b>25/-</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">PH (Dviyang) : <strong>Rs.</strong> <b>25/-</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates have to pay their Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking / UPI and Other Fee Payment Mode Only.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>UPSSSC Forest Guard, Wild Life Guard Notification 2023 : Age Limit</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Age Limit As On 01 July 2023</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Minimum Age :&nbsp;<b>18 Years</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Maximum Age :&nbsp;<b>40 Years</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation as per UPSSSC Forest Guard, Wild Life Guard Recruitment Rules.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Use <span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffff00;\"> </span>Tool – </span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>UPSSSC Forest Guard, Wild Life Guard 2023 : Vacancy Details</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Total Posts : 709 Posts</strong></span></p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>No. of Posts</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Forest Guard</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">693</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Wild Life Guard</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">16</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>UPSSSC Stenographer 2023 : Educational Qualification</b></span></h3>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 26.3983%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 73.6017%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Eligibility&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 26.3983%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Forest Guard</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 73.6017%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates who have passed their Passed Class 12th (Intermediate) Examination from any Recognized Board in India will be eligible for this post.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates should have UPSSSC PET 2022 Score Card.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 26.3983%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Wild Life Guard</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 73.6017%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates who have passed their Passed Class 12th (Intermediate) Examination from any Recognized Board in India will be eligible for this post.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates should have UPSSSC PET 2022 Score Card.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>UPSSSC Forest Guard, Wild Life Guard Online Form 2023 : </strong></span><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Mode of Selection</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Shortlisting</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Written Exam</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">PET &amp; PMT Test</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Document Verification</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Medical Examination</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Instructions for Downloading the UPSSSC Forest Guard/ Wild Guard 10/2023 Medical Admit Card 2026</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Check the Important Links section.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Then click on the Download Medical Admit Card link.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">After clicking on the link, candidates will be redirected to the Dashboard page.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">In this page candidates have to fill up the following fields with proper details:</span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Candidate’s Registration Number</strong></span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Date of Birth</strong></span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Gender</strong></span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Verification Code</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Then the candidates will be required to submit the details in order to download the Admit Card.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable2\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><strong>Follow SarkariExam on Instagram</strong></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"3\" data-align=\"center\"><strong></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><b>Join Our WhatsApp Channel</b></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"3\" data-align=\"center\"><strong><a href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Follow Now</a></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; padding: 0px;\" colspan=\"7\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3><strong>Important Links</strong></h3>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tcell\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"56%\">\n<h4><span style=\"color: #800000;\"><strong>Download Medical Admit Card</strong></span></h4>\n</td>\n<td class=\"tcell\" colspan=\"4\" width=